  "purpose": "<p>The Defence Committee is appointed by the House of Commons to examine the expenditure, administration, and policy of the Ministry of Defence and its associated public bodies.</p>\r\n<p>Follow us on social media: <u><a href=\"https://bsky.app/profile/hoccommittees.parliament.uk\">Bluesky</a></u>&nbsp;|&nbsp;<u><a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=61579513151155\">Facebook</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.instagram.com/ukcommonscommittees\">Instagram</a></u><u></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/showcase/house-of-commons-committees\">LinkedIn</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/user/UKCommonsCommittees/\">Reddit</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://x.com/HoCcommitteesUK\">X</a></u>&nbsp;| <u><a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLj3mInRJqIekxA--aDW780T_TUCwjea4M\">YouTube</a></u></p>\r\n<p>Sign up to the weekly cross-committee newsletter, ‘<a href=\"https://mailchi.mp/email/committeecorridor\">Committee Corridor</a>’</p>\r\n<p>The Committee also has a <a href=\"https://committees.parliament.uk/committee/343/defence-subcommittee/\">Sub-Committee to inquire into topics of its choosing</a>.</p>",
